flowchart TD
    A[Interview Q&A workflow] --> B[Frontend input]
    B --> B1[Job IDs]
    B --> B2[CV path]
    B --> B3[Recent days]
    B --> B4[Max jobs]
    B --> B5[Start job time]
    B --> B6[Company name]
    B --> B7[Company website]
    B --> B8[JD text or JD file]
    B --> B9[Force]
    B --> B10[Shutdown when completed]

    A --> C[Frontend normalization]
    C --> C1[Repeat --job-id]
    C --> C2[Add --cv-path]
    C --> C3[Clamp --recent-days]
    C --> C4[Clamp --limit]
    C --> C5[Encode company metadata]
    C --> C6[Encode --jd-text-base64]
    C --> C7[Convert run_at to ISO UTC]
    C --> C8[Show DB-window or custom-only hint]

    C --> D{Has run_at?}
    D -->|No| E[Create running automation run]
    D -->|Yes| F[Create pending automation run]
    F --> F1[Store scheduled_for and scheduled_args]
    F1 --> F2[Scheduler date trigger]
    F2 --> F3[execute_pending_run]
    F3 --> G[execute_action_run]
    E --> G

    F --> F4[Restart after scheduled_for can leave run pending]
    F4 --> F5[UI rescue actions]
    F5 --> F6[Recall]
    F5 --> F7[Set Time]

    G --> H[Spawn predict_night.py]
    H --> H1[Compatibility wrapper to interview_qa.runner]
    H --> I{Feature flag on or force?}
    I -->|No| J[Skip safely]
    I -->|Yes| K[Read CV]

    K --> L[Decode custom JD and company metadata]
    L --> M{Custom JD only mode?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Skip DB load]
    M -->|No| O[Load jobs from SQLite]
    N --> P[Build custom candidate jobs]
    O --> Q[Merge DB jobs with custom jobs]
    P --> R[Build candidate jobs]
    Q --> R
    R --> S[Load payload context and external seed URLs]
    S --> T[Fetch lightweight external pages]
    T --> U[Collect source documents]
    U --> V[Collect evidence]
    V --> W[Assemble prompt]
    W --> X[Generate with local model]
    X --> Y{Vet pass?}
    Y -->|Yes| Z[Vet result]
    Y -->|No| ZA[Use generate result]
    Z --> ZB[Persist per-job result]
    ZA --> ZB
    ZB --> ZC[Write summary artifacts and logs]
    ZC --> ZD{Shutdown flag?}
    ZD -->|Yes| ZE[Issue shutdown]
    ZD -->|No| ZF[Finish run]

    A --> R1[Custom JD semantics]
    R1 --> R2[Company name labels synthetic job]
    R1 --> R3[Company website becomes primary crawl seed]
    R1 --> R4[URLs inside JD text become extra seeds]
    R1 --> R5[Recent days and Max jobs only scope DB jobs]

    A --> S1[Output contract]
    S1 --> S2[summary json md and events jsonl]
    S1 --> S3[job result json per DB or custom job]
    S3 --> S4[company website and external seed urls]
    S3 --> S5[source documents and evidence chunks]
    S3 --> S6[qa metrics and generated_at]
    S3 --> S7[Detail modal can download combined txt export client-side]

    A --> T1[Lightweight pipeline for weak machines]
    T1 --> T2[Source priority]
    T2 --> T3[Company website and product pages first]
    T2 --> T4[Heavy JS or PDF only when needed]
    T1 --> T5[Robots-aware crawl]
    T1 --> T6[Minimal text extraction]
    T1 --> T7[Rule-based or light ranking before Qwen]
    T1 --> T8[Cache external pages before LLM]
